graph TB
    subgraph Router["llm-d-router"]
        subgraph EPP["epp - Endpoint Picker (Deployment / StatefulSet)"]
            ExtProc["ext-proc gRPC server<br/>9002/TCP"]
            Health["gRPC health<br/>9003/TCP"]
            Plugins["Scheduling plugin pipeline<br/>parse / flow control / filters /<br/>scorers / pickers"]
            Datastore["In-memory endpoint datastore"]
            PoolCtl[InferencePool controller]
            PodCtl[Pod controller]
            ObjCtl[InferenceObjective controller]
            RewriteCtl[InferenceModelRewrite controller]
            MetricsSrv["Metrics server<br/>9090/TCP /metrics + pprof"]
            KVSub["KV-events subscriber<br/>ZMQ 5557/TCP (optional)"]
            ExtProc --> Plugins
            Plugins --> Datastore
            PoolCtl --> Datastore
            PodCtl --> Datastore
            ObjCtl --> Plugins
            RewriteCtl --> Plugins
            KVSub --> Datastore
        end
        Sidecar["pd-sidecar<br/>HTTP reverse proxy 8000/TCP<br/>P/D and E/P/D disaggregation"]
        Coordinator["coordinator<br/>OpenAI-compatible server 8080/TCP<br/>async-broker / render / encode / prefill / decode"]
        Charts["Helm charts<br/>llm-d-router-gateway / llm-d-router-standalone / routerlib"]
        ConfigFile["EndpointPickerConfig<br/>(file schema, llm-d.ai v1/v1alpha1)"]
    end

    ConfigFile -->|--config-file / --config-text| Plugins

    InferencePool["InferencePool CR<br/>inference.networking.k8s.io/v1"]
    InferenceObjective["InferenceObjective CR<br/>llm-d.ai v1/v1alpha2"]
    InferenceModelRewrite["InferenceModelRewrite CR<br/>llm-d.ai v1alpha2"]
    Pods[Model server Pods]

    InferencePool -->|watched by| PoolCtl
    Pods -->|watched by| PodCtl
    InferenceObjective -->|watched by| ObjCtl
    InferenceModelRewrite -->|watched by| RewriteCtl

    Gateway["Gateway API impl.<br/>Istio / OSSM / AgentGateway / Envoy"] -->|ext-proc callout gRPC 9002| ExtProc
    Gateway -->|routes inference| ModelServers["vLLM / SGLang model servers"]
    Gateway -->|routes inference| Sidecar
    Sidecar -->|prefill / encode| ModelServers
    Sidecar -->|decode localhost 8200| ModelServers
    Coordinator -->|encode / prefill / decode HTTP 80| Gateway
    Coordinator -->|async broker| Redis["Redis / llm-d-async"]
    Plugins -->|scrape vllm metrics| ModelServers
    ModelServers -->|KV events ZMQ| KVSub
    Plugins -.->|optional| Tokenizer[vLLM tokenizer]
    Plugins -.->|optional| Predictor[Latency predictor servers]
    EPP -->|watch, leases, TokenReview/SAR| K8sAPI[Kubernetes API]
    EPP -.->|OTLP traces| OTel[OpenTelemetry Collector]
    Prometheus[Prometheus] -->|scrape 9090| MetricsSrv
    KServe["KServe LLMInferenceService"] -.->|deploys| EPP
    KServe -.->|deploys| Sidecar
    Charts -.->|installs| EPP

